<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">Prismatic Siphon</ansi>

<ansi fg="command">Prismatic Siphon</ansi> is used by the Splitlights of the Obelisk. The Splitlight dims
and bends its light inward, reaching for everything living in the room,
and on the next round drains life from all of it to feed itself.

<ansi fg="yellow">Counterplay: </ansi>

  The dimming is the warning, and the drain can be interrupted before it
  lands. Be careful how you strike a Splitlight at all: part of every blow
  that lands on it is refracted back at whoever struck it.

